# Vue / JS Conventions

- Always use Composition API with `<script setup>` at the top
- Components: PascalCase
- Events: camelCase
- No bare strings in templates — use i18n
- Use PropTypes in Vue components
- ESLint: Airbnb base + Vue 3 recommended

## Example

```vue
<script setup>
import { computed } from 'vue';
import { useI18n } from 'vue-i18n';

const { t } = useI18n();
const label = computed(() => t('CONVERSATION.HEADER'));
</script>

<template>
  <span>{{ label }}</span>
</template>
```
